622, "start": 124.08, "end": 126.22, "text": " But Jesus called them to him, saying,", "tokens": [50758, 583, 2705, 1219, 552, 281, 796, 11, 1566, 11, 50865], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2561078110361487, "compression_ratio": 1.6488549618320612, "no_speech_prob": 0.0396246612071991}, {"id": 25, "seek": 11622, "start": 127.1, "end": 130.2, "text": " Let the children come to me, and do not hinder them.", "tokens": [50909, 961, 264, 2227, 808, 281, 385, 11, 293, 360, 406, 276, 5669, 552, 13, 51064], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2561078110361487, "compression_ratio": 1.6488549618320612, "no_speech_prob": 0.0396246612071991}, {"id": 26, "seek": 11622, "start": 130.82, "end": 133.3, "text": " For to such belongs the kingdom of God.", "tokens": [51095, 1171, 281, 1270, 12953, 264, 10231, 295, 1265, 13, 51219], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2561078110361487, "compression_ratio": 1.6488549618320612, "no_speech_prob": 0.0396246612071991}, {"id": 27, "seek": 11622, "start": 134.0, "end": 138.74, "text": " Truly I say to you, whoever does not receive the kingdom of God like a child", "tokens": [51254, 43548, 286, 584, 281, 291, 11, 11387, 775, 406, 4774, 264, 10231, 295, 1265, 411, 257, 1440, 51491], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2561078110361487, "compression_ratio": 1.6488549618320612, "no_speech_prob": 0.0396246612071991}, {"id": 28, "seek": 11622, "start": 138.74, "end": 140.38, "text": " shall not enter it.", "tokens": [51491, 4393, 406, 3242, 309, 13, 51573], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2561078110361487, "compression_ratio": 1.6488549618320612, "no_speech_prob": 0.0396246612071991}, {"id": 29, "seek": 11622, "start": 141.18, "end": 142.86, "text": " And a ruler asked him,", "tokens": [51613, 400, 257, 19661, 2351, 796, 11, 51697], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2561078110361487, "compression_ratio": 1.6488549618320612, "no_speech_prob": 0.0396246612071991}, {"id": 30, "seek": 11622, "start": 143.26, "end": 146.2, "text":