se witness, honor your father and mother.", "tokens": [51061, 360, 406, 6155, 7908, 7286, 11, 5968, 428, 3086, 293, 2895, 13, 51227], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2574429852621896, "compression_ratio": 1.5854700854700854, "no_speech_prob": 0.0038238291162997484}, {"id": 37, "seek": 14620, "start": 164.2, "end": 164.94, "text": " And he said,", "tokens": [51265, 400, 415, 848, 11, 51302], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2574429852621896, "compression_ratio": 1.5854700854700854, "no_speech_prob": 0.0038238291162997484}, {"id": 38, "seek": 14620, "start": 165.64, "end": 167.92, "text": " All these I have kept from my youth.", "tokens": [51337, 1057, 613, 286, 362, 4305, 490, 452, 7503, 13, 51451], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2574429852621896, "compression_ratio": 1.5854700854700854, "no_speech_prob": 0.0038238291162997484}, {"id": 39, "seek": 14620, "start": 168.62, "end": 171.0, "text": " When Jesus heard this, he said to him,", "tokens": [51486, 1133, 2705, 2198, 341, 11, 415, 848, 281, 796, 11, 51605], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2574429852621896, "compression_ratio": 1.5854700854700854, "no_speech_prob": 0.0038238291162997484}, {"id": 40, "seek": 14620, "start": 171.7, "end": 173.54, "text": " One thing you still lack.", "tokens": [51640, 1485, 551, 291, 920, 5011, 13, 51732], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2574429852621896, "compression_ratio": 1.5854700854700854, "no_speech_prob": 0.0038238291162997484}, {"id": 41, "seek": 14620, "start": 174.12, "end": 176.12, "text": " Sell all that you have and distribute,", "tokens": [51761, 44296, 439, 300, 291, 362, 293, 20594, 11, 51861], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2574429852621896, "compression_ratio": 1.5854700854700854, "no_speech_prob": 0.0038238291162997484}, {"id": 42, "seek": 17620, "start": 176.78, "end": 179.1, "text": " and you will have treasure in heaven.", "tokens": [50394, 293, 291, 486, 362, 12985, 294, 7162, 13, 50510], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20781564712524414, "compression_ratio": 1.706896551724138, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012350986944511533}, {"id": 43, "seek": 17620, "start": 179.64, "end": 181.5, "text": " And come, follow me.", "tokens": [50537, 400, 808, 11, 1524, 385, 13, 50630], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20781564712524414, "compression_ratio": 1.706896551724138, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012350986944511533}, {"id": 44, "seek": 17620, "start": 182.17999999999998, "end": 185.2, "text": " But when he heard these things, he became very sad,", "tokens": [50664, 583, 562, 415, 2198, 613, 721, 11, 415, 3062, 588, 4227, 11, 50815], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20781564712524414, "compression_ratio": 1.706896551724138, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012350986944511533}, {"id": 45, "seek": 17620, "start": 185.67999999999998, "end": 187.48, "text": " for he was extremely rich.", "tokens": [50839, 337, 415, 390, 4664, 4593, 13, 50929], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20781564712524414, "compression_ratio": 1.706896551724138, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012350986944511533}, {"id": 46, "seek": 17620, "start": 188.22, "end": 191.06, "text": " Jesus, seeing that he had become sad, said,", "tokens": [50966, 2705, 11, 2577, 300, 415, 632, 1813, 4227, 11, 848, 11, 51108], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20781564712524414, "compression_ratio": 1.706896551724138, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012350986944511533}, {"id": 47, "seek": 17620, "start": 191.85999999999999, "end": 196.14, "text": " How difficult it is for those who have wealth to enter the kingdom of God!", "tokens": [51148, 1012, 2252, 309, 307, 337, 729, 567, 362, 7203, 281, 3242, 264, 10231, 295, 1265, 0, 51362], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20781564712524414, "compression_ratio": 1.706896551724138, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012350986944511533}, {"id": 48, "seek": 17620, "start": 196.73999999999998, "end": 200.2, "text": " For it is easier for a camel to go through the eye of a needle", "tokens": [51392, 1171, 309, 307, 3571, 337, 257, 37755, 281, 352, 807, 264, 3313, 295, 257, 11037, 51565], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20781564712524414, "compression_ratio": 1.706896551724138, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012350986944511533}, {"id": 49, "seek": 17620, "start": 200.2, "end": 203.33999999999997, "text": " than for a rich person to enter the kingdom of God.", "tokens": [51565, 813, 337, 257, 4593, 954, 281, 3242, 264, 10231, 295, 1265, 13, 51722], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20781564712524414, "compression_ratio": 1.706896551724138, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012350986944511533}, {"id": 50, "seek": 17620, "start": 203.95999999999998, "end": 205.35999999999999, "text": " Those who heard it said,", "tokens": [51753, 3950, 567, 2198, 309, 848, 11, 51823], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20781564712524414, "compression_ratio": 1.706896551724138, "no_speech_prob": 0.0012350986944511533}, {"id": 51, "seek": 20536, "start": 205.36, "end": 207.9, "text": " Then who can be saved?", "tokens": [50365, 1396, 567, 393, 312, 6624, 30, 50492], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20143288964623804, "compression_ratio": 1.6304347826086956, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006262905080802739}, {"id": 52, "seek": 20536, "start": 208.66000000000003, "end": 209.42000000000002, "text": " But he said,", "tokens": [50530, 583, 415, 848, 11, 50568], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20143288964623804, "compression_ratio": 1.6304347826086956, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006262905080802739}, {"id": 53, "seek": 20536, "start": 210.18, "end": 213.98000000000002, "text": " What is impossible with men is possible with God.", "tokens": [50606, 708, 307, 6243, 365, 1706, 307, 1944, 365, 1265, 13, 50796], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20143288964623804, "compression_ratio": 1.6304347826086956, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006262905080802739}, {"id": 54, "seek": 20536, "start": 214.62, "end": 215.70000000000002, "text": " And Peter said,", "tokens": [50828, 400, 6508, 848, 11, 50882], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20143288964623804, "compression_ratio": 1.6304347826086956, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006262905080802739}, {"id": 55, "seek": 20536, "start": 216.44000000000003, "end": 219.42000000000002, "text": " See, we have left our homes and followed you.", "tokens": [50919, 3008, 11, 321, 362, 1411, 527, 7388, 293, 6263, 291, 13, 51068], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20143288964623804, "compression_ratio": 1.6304347826086956, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006262905080802739}, {"id": 56, "seek": 20536, "start": 220.04000000000002, "end": 221.20000000000002, "text": " And he said to them,", "tokens": [51099, 400, 415, 848, 281, 552, 11, 51157], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20143288964623804, "compression_ratio": 1.6304347826086956, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006262905080802739}, {"id": 57, "seek": 20536, "start": 221.94000000000003, "end": 223.08, "text": " Truly I say to you,", "tokens": [51194, 43548, 286, 584, 281, 291, 11, 51251], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20143288964623804, "compression_ratio": 1.6304347826086956, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006262905080802739}, {"id": 58, "seek": 20536, "start": 223.58, "end": 226.5, "text": " there is no one who has left house or wife or brothers", "tokens": [51276, 456, 307, 572, 472, 567, 575, 1411, 1782, 420, 3836, 420, 8452, 51422], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20143288964623804, "compression_ratio": 1.6304347826086956, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006262905080802739}, {"id": 59, "seek": 20536, "start": 226.5, "end": 229.72000000000003, "text": " or parents or children for the sake of the kingdom of God", "tokens": [51422, 420, 3152, 420, 2227, 337, 264, 9717, 295, 264, 10231, 295, 1265, 51583], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20143288964623804, "compression_ratio": 1.6304347826086956, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006262905080802739}, {"id": 60, "seek": 20536, "start": 229.72000000000003, "end": 233.04000000000002, "text": " who will not receive many times more in this time", "tokens": [51583, 567, 486, 406, 4774, 867, 1413, 544, 294, 341, 565, 51749], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20143288964623804, "compression_ratio": 1.6304347826086956, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006262905080802739}, {"id": 61, "seek": 20536, "start": 233.04000000000002, "end": 235.06, "text": " and in the age to come.", "tokens": [51749, 293, 294, 264, 3205, 281, 808, 13, 51850], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20143288964623804, "compression_ratio": 1.6304347826086956, "no_speech_prob": 0.0006262905080802739}, {"id": 62, "seek": 23536, "start": 235.36, "end": 236.52, "text": " Eternal life.", "tokens": [50365, 44432, 993, 13, 50423], "temperature": 0.2, "avg_logprob": -0.24587025262613213, "compression_ratio": 1.6475409836065573, "no_speech_prob": 0.0013351549860090017}, {"id": 63, "seek": 23536, "start": 237.94000000000003, "end": 240.58, "text": " And taking the twelve, he said to them,", "tokens": [50494, 400, 1940, 264, 14390, 11, 415, 848, 281, 552, 11, 50626], "temperature": 0.2, "avg_logprob": -0.24587025262613213, "compression_ratio": 1.6475409836065573, "no_speech_prob": 0.0013351549860090017}, {"id": 64, "seek": 23536, "start": 241.44000000000003, "end": 243.76000000000002, "text": " See, we are going up to Jerusalem,", "tokens": [50669, 3008, 11, 321, 366, 516, 493, 281, 15393, 11, 50785], "temperature": 0.2, "avg_logprob": -0.24587025262613213, "compression_ratio": 1.6475409836065573, "no_speech_prob": 0.0013351549860090017}, {"id": 65, "seek": 23536, "start": 244.24, "end": 247.22000000000003, "text": " and everything that is written about the Son of Man by the prophets", "tokens": [50809, 293, 1203, 300, 307, 3720, 466, 264, 5185, 295, 2458, 538, 264, 27297, 50958], "temperature": 0.2, "avg_logprob": -0.24587025262613213, "compression_ratio": 1.6475409836065573, "no_speech_prob": 0.0013351549860090017}, {"id": 66, "seek": 23536, "start": 247.22000000000003, "end": 248.16000000000003, "text": " will be accomplished.", "tokens": [50958, 486, 312, 15419, 13, 51005], "temperature": 0.2, "avg_logprob": -0.24587025262613213, "compression_ratio": 1.6475409836065573, "no_speech_prob": 0.0013351549860090017}, {"id": 67, "seek": 23536, "start": 249.02, "end": 251.62, "text": " For he will be delivered over to the Gentiles", "tokens": [51048, 1171, 415, 486, 312, 10144, 670, 281, 264, 33070, 4680, 51178], "temperature": 0.2, "avg_logprob": -0.24587025262613213, "compression_ratio": 1.6475409836065573, "no_speech_prob": 0.0013351549860090017}, {"id": 68, "seek": 23536, "start": 251.62, "end": 255.18, "text": " and will be mocked and shamefully treated and spit upon.", "tokens": [51178, 293, 486, 312, 17362, 292, 293, 10069, 2277, 8668, 293, 22127, 3564, 13, 51356], "temperature": 0.2, "avg_logprob": -0.24587025262613213, "compression_ratio": 1.6475409836065573, "no_speech_prob": 0.0013351549860090017}, {"id": 69, "seek": 23536, "start": 255.68, "end": 258.16, "text": " And after flogging him, they will kill him.", "tokens": [51381, 400, 934, 932, 664, 3249, 796, 11, 436, 486, 1961, 796, 13, 51505], "temperature": 0.2, "avg_logprob": -0.24587025262613213, "compression_ratio": 1.6475409836065573, "no_speech_prob": 0.0013351549860090017}, {"id": 70, "seek": 23536, "start": 258.64, "end": 261.68, "text": " And on the third day he will rise.", "tokens": [51529, 400, 322, 264, 2636, 786, 415, 486, 6272, 13, 51681], "temperature": 0.2, "avg_logprob": -0.24587025262613213, "compression_ratio": 1.6475409836065573, "no_speech_prob": 0.0013351549860090017}, {"id": 71, "seek": 23536, "start": 262.02000000000004, "end": 264.38, "text": " But they understood none of these things.", "tokens": [51698, 583, 436, 7320, 6022, 295, 613, 721, 13, 51816], "temperature": 0.2, "avg_logprob": -0.24587025262613213, "compression_ratio": 1.6475409836065573, "no_speech_prob": 0.0013351549860090017}, {"id": 72, "seek": 26438, "start": 264.38, "end": 266.74, "text": " This saying was hidden from them,", "tokens": [50365, 639, 1566, 390, 7633, 490, 552, 11, 50483], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2171970335375361, "compression_ratio": 1.5913043478260869, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016740410355851054}, {"id": 73, "seek": 26438, "start": 267.0, "end": 268.86, "text": " and they did not grasp what was said.", "tokens": [50496, 293, 436, 630, 406, 21743, 437, 390, 848, 13, 50589], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2171970335375361, "compression_ratio": 1.5913043478260869, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016740410355851054}, {"id": 74, "seek": 26438, "start": 270.34, "end": 272.15999999999997, "text": " As he drew near to Jericho,", "tokens": [50663, 1018, 415, 12804, 2651, 281, 8139, 33082, 11, 50754], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2171970335375361, "compression_ratio": 1.5913043478260869, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016740410355851054}, {"id": 75, "seek": 26438, "start": 272.64, "end": 274.96, "text": " a blind man was sitting by the roadside begging.", "tokens": [50778, 257, 6865, 587, 390, 3798, 538, 264, 3060, 1812, 26600, 13, 50894], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2171970335375361, "compression_ratio": 1.5913043478260869, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016740410355851054}, {"id": 76, "seek": 26438, "start": 275.62, "end": 277.3, "text": " And hearing a crowd going by,", "tokens": [50927, 400, 4763, 257, 6919, 516, 538, 11, 51011], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2171970335375361, "compression_ratio": 1.5913043478260869, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016740410355851054}, {"id": 77, "seek": 26438, "start": 277.56, "end": 279.06, "text": " he inquired what this meant.", "tokens": [51024, 415, 13570, 1824, 437, 341, 4140, 13, 51099], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2171970335375361, "compression_ratio": 1.5913043478260869, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016740410355851054}, {"id": 78, "seek": 26438, "start": 279.8, "end": 280.58, "text": " They told him,", "tokens": [51136, 814, 1907, 796, 11, 51175], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2171970335375361, "compression_ratio": 1.5913043478260869, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016740410355851054}, {"id": 79, "seek": 26438, "start": 281.24, "end": 283.3, "text": " Jesus of Nazareth is passing by.", "tokens": [51208, 2705, 295, 11870, 40414, 307, 8437, 538, 13, 51311], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2171970335375361, "compression_ratio": 1.5913043478260869, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016740410355851054}, {"id": 80, "seek": 26438, "start": 284.12, "end": 285.1, "text": " And he cried out,", "tokens": [51352, 400, 415, 16266, 484, 11, 51401], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2171970335375361, "compression_ratio": 1.5913043478260869, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016740410355851054}, {"id": 81, "seek": 26438, "start": 285.76, "end": 288.9, "text": " Jesus, Son of David,", "tokens": [51434, 2705, 11, 5185, 295, 4389, 11, 51591], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2171970335375361, "compression_ratio": 1.5913043478260869, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016740410355851054}, {"id": 82, "seek": 26438, "start": 289.52, "end": 291.42, "text": " have mercy on me.", "tokens": [51622, 362, 13174, 322, 385, 13, 51717], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2171970335375361, "compression_ratio": 1.5913043478260869, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016740410355851054}, {"id": 83, "seek": 26438, "start": 292.15999999999997, "end": 294.0, "text": " And those who were in front rebuked him,", "tokens": [51754, 400, 729, 567, 645, 294, 1868, 12970, 2034, 292, 796, 11, 51846], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2171970335375361, "compression_ratio": 1.5913043478260869, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016740410355851054}, {"id": 84, "seek": 26438, "start": 294.0, "end": 294.36, "text": " telling him,", "tokens": [51846, 3585, 796, 11, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2171970335375361, "compression_ratio": 1.5913043478260869, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016740410355851054}, {"id": 85, "seek": 29436, "start": 294.36, "end": 297.5, "text": " But he cried out all the more,", "tokens": [50365, 583, 415, 16266, 484, 439, 264, 544, 11, 50522], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2660445203684797, "compression_ratio": 1.5404040404040404, "no_speech_prob": 0.003098043380305171}, {"id": 86, "seek": 29436, "start": 298.26, "end": 302.56, "text": " Son of David, have mercy on me.", "tokens": [50560, 5185, 295, 4389, 11, 362, 13174, 322, 385, 13, 50775], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2660445203684797, "compression_ratio": 1.5404040404040404, "no_speech_prob": 0.003098043380305171}, {"id": 87, "seek": 29436, "start": 303.32, "end": 306.2, "text": " And Jesus stopped and commanded him to be brought to him.", "tokens": [50813, 400, 2705, 5936, 293, 34359, 796, 281, 312, 3038, 281, 796, 13, 50957], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2660445203684797, "compression_ratio": 1.5404040404040404, "no_speech_prob": 0.003098043380305171}, {"id": 88, "seek": 29436, "start": 306.84000000000003, "end": 308.68, "text": " And when he came near, he asked him,", "tokens": [50989, 400, 562, 415, 1361, 2651, 11, 415, 2351, 796, 11, 51081], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2660445203684797, "compression_ratio": 1.5404040404040404, "no_speech_prob": 0.003098043380305171}, {"id": 89, "seek": 29436, "start": 309.38, "end": 311.36, "text": " What do you want me to do for you?", "tokens": [51116, 708, 360, 291, 528, 385, 281, 360, 337, 291, 30, 51215], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2660445203684797, "compression_ratio": 1.5404040404040404, "no_speech_prob": 0.003098043380305171}, {"id": 90, "seek": 29436, "start": 312.08000000000004, "end": 312.72, "text": " He said,", "tokens": [51251, 634, 848, 11, 51283], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2660445203684797, "compression_ratio": 1.5404040404040404, "no_speech_prob": 0.003098043380305171}, {"id": 91, "seek": 29436, "start": 313.42, "end": 317.24, "text": " Lord, let me recover my sight.", "tokens": [51318, 3257, 11, 718, 385, 8114, 452, 7860, 13, 51509], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2660445203684797, "compression_ratio": 1.5404040404040404, "no_speech_prob": 0.003098043380305171}, {"id": 92, "seek": 29436, "start": 317.72, "end": 319.26, "text": " And Jesus said to him,", "tokens": [51533, 400, 2705, 848, 281, 796, 11, 51610], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2660445203684797, "compression_ratio": 1.5404040404040404, "no_speech_prob": 0.003098043380305171}, {"id": 93, "seek": 29436, "start": 320.06, "end": 321.32, "text": " Recover your sight.", "tokens": [51650, 1300, 12516, 428, 7860, 13, 51713], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2660445203684797, "compression_ratio": 1.5404040404040404, "no_speech_prob": 0.003098043380305171}, {"id": 94, "seek": 29436, "start": 321.88, "end": 323.92, "text": " Your faith has made you well.", "tokens": [51741, 2260, 4522, 575, 1027, 291, 731, 13, 51843], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2660445203684797, "compression_ratio": 1.5404040404040404, "no_speech_prob": 0.003098043380305171}, {"id": 95, "seek": 32436, "start": 324.36, "end": 326.68, "text": " And immediately he recovered his sight", "tokens": [50365, 400, 4258, 415, 19542, 702, 7860, 50481], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3038685889471145, "compression_ratio": 1.2477064220183487, "no_speech_prob": 0.00038896422483958304}, {"id": 96, "seek": 32436, "start": 326.68, "end": 328.98, "text": " and followed him, glorifying God.", "tokens": [50481, 293, 6263, 796, 11, 26623, 5489, 1265, 13, 50596], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3038685889471145, "compression_ratio": 1.2477064220183487, "no_speech_prob": 0.00038896422483958304}, {"id": 97, "seek": 32436, "start": 329.52000000000004, "end": 331.68, "text": " And all the people, when they saw it,", "tokens": [50623, 400, 439, 264, 561, 11, 562, 436, 1866, 309, 11, 50731], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3038685889471145, "compression_ratio": 1.2477064220183487, "no_speech_prob": 0.00038896422483958304}, {"id": 98, "seek": 32436, "start": 331.76, "end": 333.18, "text": " gave praise to God.", "tokens": [50735, 2729, 13286, 281, 1265, 13, 50806], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3038685889471145, "compression_ratio": 1.2477064220183487, "no_speech_prob": 0.00038896422483958304}, {"id": 99, "seek": 32436, "start": 333.18, "end": 334.18, "text": " Amen.", "tokens": [50806, 14092, 13, 50856], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3038685889471145, "compression_ratio": 1.2477064220183487, "no_speech_prob": 0.00038896422483958304}], "language": "English"}